  "clause_1_scope": "This standard ( Part 2 ) provides methods of planning and conducting experiments using orthogonal array ( OA ) tables when all the factors are either at two levels or at three levels. The procedure is also discussed when some of the factors are at two levels and the remaining at three or four levels. It also describes the procedure for the analysis of the data and selection of the optimum level of each factor.",
